msgid "Migration Guide"
msgstr ""

msgid "We just released our second Alpha for Quarkus 2.0."
msgstr ""

msgid "We had a lot of feedback and Continuous Testing got a lot of fixes and improvements."
msgstr ""

msgid "Please keep the feedback coming!"
msgstr ""

msgid "If you have missed our Alpha1 announcement: here are link:/blog/quarkus-2-0-0-alpha1-released/[the main new features of Quarkus 2.0]."
msgstr ""

